---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Partner with FashionPlusBeauty"
  description="Explore advertising, sponsorship and partnership opportunities with FashionPlusBeauty."
  canonicalPath="/partner/"
>
  <section class="static-page-hero" aria-labelledby="partner-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Thoughtful partnerships</p>
    <h1 id="partner-title">Let's make something lovely.</h1>
    <p>We are building a considered home for fashion, beauty and everyday living—and for partnerships that feel like a natural fit.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose-page">
    <h2>Ways to work together</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sponsored stories:</strong> clearly labeled collaborations with a point of view that fits the publication.</li>
      <li><strong>Display advertising:</strong> reserved placements for suitable brands, subject to availability and platform approval.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate features:</strong> useful shopping guides with clearly disclosed tracked links where appropriate.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not publish audience or reach figures until they are measured. The media kit, rate card and campaign workflow are being prepared as the publication grows.</p>
    <div class="contact-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
      <strong>Tell us what you have in mind.</strong>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@fashionplusbeauty.com">hello@fashionplusbeauty.com</a> with the campaign, timing and budget range. Replace and verify this address before launch.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
